   "stem_html": "<ol class=\"os-raise-noindent\" start=\"6\">\n    <li>Which of the following represents the domain of the function graphed below?</li>\n  </ol>\n  <p><img alt=\"GRAPH OF A LINE FOR ALL X GREATER THAN OR EQUAL TO 2, WITH POINT SHOWN AT (2 5), AND PASSING THROUGH THE POINTS (3, 8) AND (5, 14).\" src=\"exercises/media/6bb8142a326572bf.jpg\" width=\"300\"></p>",
